      'Start with new inquiries for the company’s normal geography and event types. Severe allergy questions, medical diet claims, alcohol service, unusual venues, fire or cooking restrictions, very short notice, minors, disputed deposits, custom contract terms, and requests outside standard capacity leave routine qualification. Culinary, operations, sales, and contract owners decide feasibility and the customer commitment.',
